msgid "This book was originally created by **Elisa de Castro Guerra**, designer and `educational instructor <http://activdesign.eu/>`_. It was created as a reference guide for learning Inkscape."
msgstr "Den här boken skapades ursprungligen av **Elisa de Castro Guerra**, designer och `utbildningsinstruktör <http://activdesign.eu/>`_. Den skapades som en referensguide för att lära sig Inkscape."

#. from yeager:inkscape
msgid "The book was translated from French to English in 2016-2017."
msgstr "Boken översattes från franska till engelska under 2016-2017."

#. from yeager:inkscape
