msgstr "ställ in penselbredden till minimum eller maximum"

#. from yeager:inkscape
msgid "adjust tweaking force"
msgstr "justera finjusteringskraft"

#. from yeager:inkscape
msgid "Width and force can be adjusted while drawing. With a pressure-sensitive tablet, force also depends on pen pressure."
msgstr "Bredd och kraft kan justeras medan du ritar. Med en tryckkänslig ritplatta beror kraften också på penntrycket."

#. from yeager:inkscape
