msgid "Methods to generate the ellipse\n- Auto ellipse: fits a circle (2, 3 or 4 nodes in the path) or an ellipse (at least 5 nodes)\n- Force circle: (at least 2 nodes) always create a circle\n- Isometric circle: (3 nodes) use first two segments as edges\n- Perspective circle: (4 nodes) circle in a square in perspective view\n- Steiner ellipse: (3 nodes) ellipse on a triangle\n- Steiner inellipse: (3 nodes) ellipse inside a triangle"
